{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ve confirmed the last two snapshots were materially different: `r0001` switched to ladder search with SDE stage-1 and extra confirmations, but the main net effect was just more previews at `beta=1.0` and slightly less compute at `beta=0.25`, which the ledger already says hurt. I’m reading the env/harness next to anchor the schedule to real step costs and then I’ll patch in one targeted repair: ambiguity-aware survivor allocation plus budget-filling selective refinement aimed at the weak `0.5/0.75/1.0` regimes."}}
