/flow_autotts/pickscore_sd35/history_autotts_b64_fixed_target_reference_20260527_051921/r0001_20260527_051921_793d5c44`\n- incumbent reference: `logs/flow_autotts/pickscore_sd35/history_autotts_b64_fixed_target_reference_20260527_051921/r0000_20260527_051921_793d5c44`\n- rejection reason: candidate did not beat incumbent on fixed-target frontier score\n\n| beta | cand_reward | inc_reward | delta_reward | cand_nfe | inc_nfe | cand_status | main_action_shift | likely lesson |\n| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- | --- | --- |\n| 0.250 | 0.824278 | 0.828068 | -0.003791 | 19.000 | 20.000 | below-target | mean_nfe -1.00, preview +1.00 | likely too little compute versus the baseline-matched reference |\n| 0.750 | 0.837156 | 0.839364 | -0.002208 | 48.000 | 48.000 | aligned | prune -1.00 | behavior change hurt reward-vs-NFE, but the exact mechanism is ambiguous |\n| 1.000 | 0.841956 | 0.843137 | -0.001181 | 64.000 | 62.880 | aligned | preview +2.29, mean_nfe +1.12, backward +0.85 | more preview budget did not translate into better ranking/refinement |\n\nTreat these rejected-round notes as negative evidence: avoid repeating the same action-shift pattern unless another beta clearly needs it.\n\n## Historical Action Effects\n\nNot enough prior rounds to summarize action effects yet.\n\n## Recent History\n\n### `logs/flow_autotts/pickscore_sd35/history_autotts_b64_fixed_target_reference_20260527_051921/r0000_20260527_051921_793d5c44`\n\n- controller snapshot: `logs/flow_autotts/pickscore_sd35/history_autotts_b64_fixed_target_reference_20260527_051921/r0000_20260527_051921_793d5c44/flow_autotts/controllers/optimal.py`\n- compact summary: `logs/flow_autotts/pickscore_sd35/history_autotts_b64_fixed_target_reference_20260527_051921/r0000_20260527_051921_793d5c44/proposal_results/summary.json`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"betas\": [\n    0.0,\n    0.25,\n    0.5,\n    0.75,\n    1.0\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
